# Statistics
@statistics = {{statistics}}

### Track VIEW (buffer Redis hoặc fallback MySQL)
POST {{statistics}}/api/interactions/track
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "actionType": "VIEW"
}

### Gợi ý sản phẩm
GET {{statistics}}/api/recommendations?userId=1&limit=5
